# Optional public browser overrides for a migrated or isolated test backend.
# The checked-in client defaults target this project's Lovable Cloud managed
# backend, which operators inspect through View Backend in Lovable. There is no
# separate Supabase dashboard login or credential set for this deployment.
# Never place service-role keys or other server credentials here.
